://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-printer h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\">cnic-print-opt</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-ink dark:text-paper\">CNIC &amp; ID Print Suite</h3></div></div><span class=\"rounded border border-line px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft dark:border-rule dark:text-rule\">v3.5</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft dark:text-paper/60\">Specialized CNIC &amp; identity document front + back dual layout alignment optimizer for crisp A4 printouts with watermark protection.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-ink-soft dark:text-paper/70\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Dual upload for CNIC front and CNIC back cards</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Automated document boundary alignment and aspect ratio lock</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Scan enhancement filters: high-contrast B&amp;W scan mode &amp; grayscale</span></li></ul><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-end gap-[3px] mt-5 text-gold\"><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-2.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-2.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span></span><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-line pt-4 dark:border-rule\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft dark:text-rule\">A4 · Letter · Legal</span><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-doc px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-doc-bright\" href=\"/cnic-opt\">Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article></div><section class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-rule bg-ink-2 p-6 text-paper shadow-2xl sm:p-8\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 text-gold\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-3 w-3 border-l-2 border-t-2\"></span><span class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-3 w-3 border-r-2 border-t-2\"></span><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-3 w-3 border-b-2 border-l-2\"></span><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-3 w-3 border-b-2 border-r-2\"></span></span><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-rule\">Reference — FAQ</div><h2 class=\"mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold\">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><span class=\"hidden rounded border border-rule px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rule sm:block\">Proprietary tech</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 rounded-xl border border-rule bg-ink-3 p-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-doc-bright\">What is image-optimation-tool and how does it compress images?</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">image-optimation-tool is a proprietary batch image compression engine created by Asad Bukhari. It uses client-side HTML5 Canvas processing to re-encode JPEG, PNG, WebP, and AVIF files, reducing file size by up to 80% without visible quality degradation while stripping sensitive EXIF GPS data.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 rounded-xl border border-rule bg-ink-3 p-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-doc-bright\">What is cnic-copy-print-opt used for?</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">cnic-copy-print-opt is a proprietary tool for Pakistani National Identity Cards (CNIC) and government ID documents. It allows users to upload front and back images, automatically aligns them onto a single A4 printable page, enhances text contrast, and applies protective watermark overlays to prevent identity theft.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 rounded-xl border border-rule bg-ink-3 p-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-doc-bright\">Are my sensitive identity documents uploaded to an external server?</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">No. All image processing and CNIC alignment occurs directly inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript and the HTML Canvas API. Your files never leave your device.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 rounded-xl border border-rule bg-ink-3 p-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-doc-bright\">How are these tools licensed?</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">Both image-optimation-tool and cnic-copy-print-opt are proprietary tools developed by Asad Bukhari. Access is provided via this portal for authorized enterprise and individual use.</p></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full border-t border-line bg-paper-2 text-ink-soft transition-colors dark:border-rule dark:bg-ink-2 dark:text-rule\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-6 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"space-y-3 md:col-span-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-doc font-display text-xs font-black text-white\">P</div><span class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-paper\">ZAIBI TOOLS</span></div><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed\">Proprietary suite hosting <span class=\"font-mono text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\">image optimation tool</span> and<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\">cnic-copy-print-opt</span>, developed by Asad Bukhari.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-[11px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-3.5 w-3.5 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><span>100% client-side processing</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink dark:text-paper\">Enterprise Tools</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium transition-colors hover:text-doc dark:hover:text-doc-bright\" href=\"/image-opt\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3.5 w-3.5 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Batch Image Optimizer &amp; WebP Converter</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium transition-colors hover:text-doc dark:hover:text-doc-bright\" href=\"/cnic-opt\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3.5 w-3.5 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>CNIC Print Suite</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink dark:text-paper\">Protection</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs\"><li><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors hover:text-ink dark:hover:text-paper\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Security &amp; Data Protocols</button></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink dark:text-paper\">Zero-Server Security</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed\">Your identity documents and personal images stay entirely inside your browser memory. No server uploads or remote file storage.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-line pt-4 text-[11px] dark:border-rule sm:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink dark:text-paper\">Portal Enterprise Suite</span><span class=\"h-3 w-px bg-line dark:bg-rule\"></span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-doc dark:bg-doc-bright\"></span><span>Proprietary License • Asad Bukhari</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-end gap-[3px] text-gold\"><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-2.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-2.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span><span class=\"w-px bg-current h-1.5\"></span></span><span>Zero-Retention Privacy</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-doc/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" st